[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0010","text":"……树里──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0020","text":"干嘛啊……话说，\n我就觉得你今天会来呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0030","text":"哈哈，被你料到了\n那，我就直接来了……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0040","text":"──────树里，生日快乐——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10211002_00_0050","text":"啊哈哈……你声音太大了啦……！\n嗯，谢啦，制作人"}]
